  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        Device Integration Framework\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        The device integration framework provides the necessary mechanism for communication between the application and external devices such as a Material Handling Devices (MHE). The device integration framework is composed of the following two services.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDIF Communication Service\r\n\r\nDIF Message Processing Service\r\n\r\n \n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nDevice Integration Framework\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nThe device integration framework provides the necessary mechanism for communication between the application and external devices such as a Material Handling Devices (MHE). The device integration framework is composed of the following two services.\n\r\n\r\n\n \n\r\n\r\n\nDIF Communication Service\n\r\n\r\n\nDIF Message Processing Service\n\r\n\r\n\n \n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
